#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * AURA — seasonal decorations and avatar decorations
 *
 *   Settings > Seasonal Decorations (off until you switch it on): Halloween, Autumn, Christmas and
 *   Winter, by the date or one you pick. Each part switches on and off by itself: corner decorations,
 *   falling snow/leaves and bats, the logo, lights along the top, a soft seasonal glow. Preview any
 *   season. Your theme, colours and background are never changed; switching off puts AURA back at once.
 *   Edit Profile > Avatar Decorations (off until you switch it on): seasonal frames and accessories
 *   around your picture, saved to your account and seen by friends in Friends, Messages and calls.
 *   Your picture itself is never changed.
 *
 *   Also run  supabase/aura-seasonal.sql  in Supabase (SQL Editor), once, for avatar decorations.
 *
 * How to use:  node aura-seasonal-setup.cjs      (in your AURA project folder)
 * To undo:     node aura-seasonal-setup.cjs --undo
 */
"use strict";
